{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41452","headline":"题魏坛二首 一 · 李建勳","name":"题魏坛二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不遇至真传道要，曾看真诰亦何爲。\n旧碑经乱沈荒涧，灵篆因耕出故基。\n蛙黾自喧浇药井，牛羊闲过放生池。\n萧条夕景空坛畔，朽桧枝斜绿蔓垂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}